3,"Romagnol Language (RGN) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map, Endangered Level & Official Use | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/rgn/,Romagnol is an endangered indigenous language of Italy and San Marino. It belongs to the Indo-European language family. The language is used as a first language by adults only. It is not known to be taught in schools.,Romagnol,Indo-European
